---
import Portal from '../layouts/Portal.astro';
import { resources,topics,articles } from '../data/portal';
const code = 'public interface IDeviceClient\n{\n    Task ConnectAsync();\n    Task<DeviceState> ReadAsync();\n}\n\n// Reliable by design.\nawait device.ConnectAsync();';
---
<Portal><section class="portal-hero"><div class="portal-wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="portal-kicker">INDUSTRIAL SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</div><h1>Build better.<br/>Engineer <span style="color:var(--accent)">smarter.</span></h1><p>산업 자동화 개발자를 위한 기술 문서, 학습 콘텐츠, 개발 도구를 한 곳에서 만나보세요.</p><div class="portal-actions"><a class="portal-button primary" href="/portal/docs/">Explore documentation →</a><a class="portal-button" href="/portal/learn/">Start learning</a></div></div><div class="portal-code"><header>● ● ●　ControlService.cs · 개념 예제</header><pre>{code}</pre></div></div></section>
<section class="portal-section"><div class="portal-wrap"><h2>Developer resources</h2><p>개발에 필요한 핵심 리소스를 탐색하세요.</p><div class="portal-grid">{resources.map(r=><a class="portal-card" href={'/portal/'+r.slug+'/'}><span class="portal-symbol">{r.icon}</span><h3>{r.title}</h3><p>{r.description}</p><span class="portal-more">Explore →</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="portal-section"><div class="portal-wrap"><h2>Explore technologies</h2><p>기술 분야별 지식 라이브러리</p><div class="portal-grid">{topics.map((t,i)=><a class="portal-card" href={'/portal/docs/#topic-'+i}><span class="portal-symbol">{t.icon}</span><h3>{t.title}</h3><p>{t.description}</p><span class="portal-more">Explore →</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="portal-section"><div class="portal-wrap"><h2>Engineering articles</h2><p>기존 기술 기록을 탐색하세요.</p>{articles.map(a=><a class="portal-entry" href={a.href}><h3>{a.title} →</h3><p>{a.description}</p></a>)}</div></section></Portal>